  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Continuing the studio interview, Kuroki and Muranishi describe what they mean to each other before Muranishi turns the camera's gaze onto his nervous female interviewer Client. Listen for \"honshin\", one's true inner feelings.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "あの方はわたくしのいわば創造主でございますから。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "彼女はアダルトビデオに革命を起こす女神です。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "黒木君とならまだ人類が見たことがないものを作れるかもしれない。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "互いに同じ時代に生きていてよかったと思える作品が撮れます。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "では逆に質問させていただきます。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "えっ、私ですか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "そうです。お口ではなく心に聞いております。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "それにしてもお美しい。声がすばらしい！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "どうなんですか、あなたの本心は？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "冗談ですので、本気になさらなくていいんですよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "お紅茶飲みますか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "頂きます。すいません。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "あの方はわたくしのいわば創造主でございますから。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'To me, he is what you might call my creator.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "彼女はアダルトビデオに革命を起こす女神です。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'She is a goddess who sparked a revolution in adult video.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "黒木君とならまだ人類が見たことがないものを作れるかもしれない。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'With Kuroki, I might create something humanity has never seen before.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "互いに同じ時代に生きていてよかったと思える作品が撮れます。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We can shoot films that make us glad we lived in the same era.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "では逆に質問させていただきます。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Allow me to ask you a question in return instead.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "えっ、私ですか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Wait—you mean me?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "そうです。お口ではなく心に聞いております。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yes, you. I am asking your heart, not your mouth.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "それにしてもお美しい。声がすばらしい！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Besides, you are truly beautiful, and your voice is wonderful!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "どうなんですか、あなたの本心は？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Tell me, what are your true feelings deep down?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "冗談ですので、本気になさらなくていいんですよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'He is only joking, so please don't take him seriously.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "お紅茶飲みますか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Would you care for some black tea?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "頂きます。すいません。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yes, thank you. Excuse me.'",
      "gap": 0.65
